  set <TASK> <name> KEY=VALUE ...               edit fields (env.X=..., after=a,b, cmd=..., ready=..., primary=true)
  rm <TASK> <name>                              stop and remove a member
  plan <TASK>                                   resolved members, order, ports, URLs, rewrites (no start)
  up <TASK> [name...] [--wait SECS]             start or refresh (default wait 100 s; idempotent, run again to go on)
  wait <TASK> [SECS]                            up until every member is ready (default 540 s)
  status <TASK> [--json]                        state of each member
  logs <TASK> <name> [LINES]                    tail the member's log
  restart <TASK> <name>                         stop the member, then up
  env <TASK> <name>                             resolved env of a member (secret-looking values masked)
  down <TASK>                                   stop everything, keep manifest and data
  destroy <TASK>                                down + delete manifest, data and logs
  list                                          all stacks
  recipe list | show WS | save <TASK> <name> [WS] | set WS KEY=VALUE ... | rm WS
                                                per-workspace defaults in """ + RECIPES + """
  guide                                         agent manual
"""

