    preview-stack status GRA-300        # URLs; the primary one is what QA opens

`--dev-url` (or the recipe's `devUrl`) on the backend makes every other member whose .env* value points at
that deployed URL get it rewritten to the backend's preview URL. Anything else: explicit env,
