## Members are yours to define
Any number of apps and services, any commands. Order with `--after`. Examples:
    preview-stack add GRA-300 mongo --service --cmd 'mongod --dbpath {{data:mongo}} --port {{port:mongo}} --bind_ip 127.0.0.1 --wiredTigerCacheSizeGB 0.25'
