    preview-stack add GRA-300 seed --service --dir <wt> --cmd 'node scripts/seed.js && sleep infinity' --after api
Apps get PORT set; a custom --cmd must listen on $PORT (or use {{port:<self>}}). Services get PORT too.
Commands run with the stack's PATH, not your shell's: give binaries by full path (/home/paperclip/services/bin/mongod).

