## Local infrastructure (Mongo, Redis, Postgres, ...): install it yourself, no root
No docker, no apt, no sudo. Install user-space binaries under /home/paperclip/services/<name>/<version>/
and symlink the binary into /home/paperclip/services/bin (put it on PATH in --cmd or use the full path):
